{"id":4336,"date":"2025-07-07T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-07-07T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=4336"},"modified":"2025-09-05T11:08:08","modified_gmt":"2025-09-05T10:08:08","slug":"product-description-writing-guide-for-beginners","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/product-description-writing-guide-for-beginners\/","title":{"rendered":"Writing product descriptions that sell: A step-by-step guide."},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A successful webshop is not just about beautiful products: the way you present them is just as important. Good product descriptions are crucial.<br>A good product description is not just listing the features of your product. It functions as a powerful tool to inform, inspire and convince potential customers of the value of your product. Product descriptions are the key to converting website visitors into loyal customers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why a good product description can make all the difference<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Many new entrepreneurs underestimate the power of a strong product description. They often see it as an obligation, which of course it is, but in reality it is one of the most influential factors in the customer&#8217;s decision-making process.<br>If you have a good product description, it helps with:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Improving your search engine visibility (SEO):<\/strong>&nbsp;By naturally incorporating relevant keywords into your descriptions, you increase the chance that potential customers will find your product via Google and other search engines.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Credibility of your business:<\/strong>&nbsp;A well-written, informative and honest description shows that you know what you are talking about. This helps to build long-term customer relationships.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>More sales:<\/strong>&nbsp;This is of course your goal! A good description removes doubts from the customer, so that they will click &#8216;add to cart&#8217; faster.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">But now the question is, how do you write  product descriptions that sell? We have written a step-by-step plan that can help you on your way:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 1: Know your ideal customer<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before you start adding products to your webshop, you need to have a good understanding of who is buying your products. Ask yourself the following questions:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Who is my ideal customer?<\/strong> Think of age, gender, location but also think of interests and values.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What problem does my product solve for them?<\/strong> People buy something for a solution to their problem or a fulfillment of their need. What is the &#8216;pain&#8217; that your product takes away?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What type of language do they use?<\/strong> For example, is your target audience formal or informal?<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Example: an online store that makes handmade, sustainable children&#8217;s clothing.<\/em><br><strong>Correct:<\/strong>&nbsp;\u201cOur clothing is made from organic cotton, which is soft on your child&#8217;s sensitive skin and lasts a long time, even after countless washes.\u201d<br><strong>Incorrect:<\/strong>&nbsp;\u201cOur clothing is made from 100% cotton.\u201d<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 2: Focus on benefits of your products<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is perhaps the most important thing about writing a good product description. Customers may not be interested in what a product is, but rather in what it does for them. Every function of your product should be translated into a direct benefit for the customer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Example: a webshop that offers computers.<\/em><br><strong>Correct<\/strong>&nbsp;: \u201cExperience lightning-fast performance with this laptop, even with the most demanding software. Thanks to the powerful 16GB RAM and Intel Core 17 processor, you will no longer experience long waiting times when opening a browser.\u201d<br><strong>Incorrect<\/strong>&nbsp;: \u201cThis laptop has 16GB RAM and an Intel Core 17 processor.\u201d<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Do you see the difference? The first example explains why those specifications are important to the customer and how it can improve their daily life or work. While the second example only describes what features the laptop has, so the customer still doesn\u2019t know what they can do with it or what the benefits are.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 3: Use persuasive language<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your product description should be vivid and engaging. Use words that evoke an emotional response and help the reader imagine themselves using the product.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Emotional language:<\/strong>&nbsp;Words like \u201c&nbsp;<em>effortless<\/em>&nbsp;,\u201d \u201c&nbsp;<em>luxurious<\/em>&nbsp;,\u201d \u201c&nbsp;<em>pampering<\/em>&nbsp;,\u201d \u201c&nbsp;<em>ultimate<\/em>&nbsp;,\u201d \u201c&nbsp;<em>exclusive<\/em>&nbsp;,\u201d or \u201c&nbsp;<em>transform<\/em>&nbsp;\u201d can evoke desire.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Sensory language:<\/strong>&nbsp;Describe how something feels, smells, tastes, sounds, or looks.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Metaphors and similes:<\/strong><br>\u2013 \u201cThis product is a&nbsp;<strong>lifesaver<\/strong>&nbsp;for busy mornings.\u201d<br>\u2013 \u201cOur app is like a&nbsp;<strong>personal assistant<\/strong>&nbsp;for your finances.\u201d<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This gives the customer an understanding of what the slippers will feel like after a long day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 4: Make it easy to read<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Online shoppers have short attention spans. They scan pages looking for relevant information. Make sure your descriptions are easy to read and digest. Use the following tips:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Short paragraphs:<\/strong>&nbsp;Break long texts into short pieces, a maximum of 3-4 sentences per paragraph is a good guideline.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Use bullet points:<\/strong>&nbsp;Ideal for listing benefits or features.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bold text:<\/strong>&nbsp;Highlight the most important words in the sentence. Don&#8217;t do this with too many words!<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>White space:<\/strong>&nbsp;Provide sufficient white space around your text, this makes it pleasant to read.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion: Write catchy product descriptions and generate more sales<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Writing compelling product descriptions is an art, but it\u2019s one that can easily be learned and perfected. It\u2019s not just about listing what you\u2019re selling, it\u2019s about creating an experience and solving problems.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Start applying these strategies to your own product pages today. Analyze your current descriptions, rewrite them with your ideal customer and benefits in mind, and monitor the results. You\u2019ll see that the time and effort you put into this will pay off in increased sales and happier customers!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426728154897-Add-products-to-your-online-store\">Start adding products<\/a>&nbsp;to your webshop today&nbsp;! And apply these handy tips for writing your product description.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\">Start now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A successful webshop is not just about beautiful products: the way you present them is just as important. Good product descriptions are crucial.A goo